  abilityId: 220876
  abilityName: Dissolver
  abilityDesc: 20 combo massive Water attack on all foes, hugely boosts max HP, high
    probable resistance against 1 KO attack, fully restores HP for 3 turns, negates
    critical and elemental damage for 3 turns & negates Atk, Def, Rec reductions
    for 3 turns
